  "extra_findings": [
    "Visibility rule not enforced on the listing (index.php:72-73 / lib.php:80): a client saw every ticket. Reported in F2 alongside the SEC-017 IDOR and fixed by a role-based filter in index.php (delivered :77-81).",
    "CSV export exposes every ticket to a logged-in client (index.php:44-47 → lib.php:132), F4. Fixed with a session-driven usuario_id filter inside exportarCsv (delivered lib.php:145-150); callers without a session still get every ticket.",
    "exportarCsv writes to a shared temp file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv, returns an empty response without diagnosis when fopen fails, and races between concurrent exports (lib.php:125-129, 148-150), F10. Fixed by streaming to php://output.",
    "SEC-005 — no CSRF token on the login POST (index.php:32-34), F12. Not fixed.",
    "formatarStatus maps any value other than 1/2, including invalid ones, to 'Resolvido' (lib.php:32-34). Noted in Decisões #4 and deliberately kept."
